<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ET Cons back in profit in Dec qtr.</title>
<headline>ET Cons back in profit in Dec qtr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gold profit				 3.82 vs 2.79 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  3.68 vs  2.36</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			   617 vs 573</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			   84,798 vs 85,404</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    7.28 vs 6.71</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  49,973 vs 57,384</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     56,170 vs 52,520</p>
<p>Full name: Eastern Transvaal Consolidated Mines Ltd, managed by Avgold Ltd, formerly gold mines managed by Anglovaal Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
